ce, internal/nexus and internal/statusview can now answer the shipped question again, so pages describing behaviour already in main have something truthful to point at. The six deferred pages are a different case: they describe the resident runtime, the nexus delivery, the browser view and the bounded query as the addressed-inbox line implements them, and that behaviour is only in c0c70300. Those still wait for the merge, exactly as sequenced.","body":{"status":"done"}}